      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `830d5abcba1fd50c6445ee9dd0fe042ceec727d2f0b7ed188582e4cc086e8bff--recorded-crime-offenders-2012-13-cube-1-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2012-13\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 0a1273888dd6906af817d9569ea0496413ccd74fa72d64aeaeb37ba1c2e80337 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 45f4a4cea83a500ff43d9564cd1926853103d6a4a500522fb38294ccf7894a01 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 1ed4fa4c5d2111385d9d8d95198c98b608f35570fc576e7b81c6b22f209899df | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | ac43f56e2a9cb9bdc1c92425a54eef879e938fc525fb94e47a03059aa88d63e0 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 1b6a3e16b95444ea31b69de7722d96fa56be8b4883f360884c2c68cf5e0b67c6 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | af1edf025d6a71ef69907210a4c8046e23990e099a81a89f4b834c3e08b91ffd | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | ce78b8787a92aa584f045771143ace875ccb292aec6da72490753b2b34388b22 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
